{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["The Cosmopolitan Prayers","Koto unknowingly seals away the Sun Goddess Amaterasu, and now she is in a different world and can't return. Meeting priestesses who combat the evil in this strange place she learns that Black Towers throughout the land keep Amatersu sealed away and are guarded by evil monsters. Koto must now find a way to help defeat these monsters and return the world to the way it was.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["超変身コス∞プレイヤー",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-112","ids":{"shikimori":112,"mal":112,"anilist":112,"kodik":"serial-28417"},"kodikIds":["serial-28417"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28417":"2020-08-06T10:07:52Z"},"title":"Жрицы мира","originalTitle":"Chou Henshin Cosprayers","alt":"The Cosmopolitan Prayers The Cosmopolitan Prayers 超変身コス∞プレイヤー","description":", страстно увлекающаяся косплеем школьница, попала в некий ритуал вместе с командой девочек-волшебниц. В результате люди исчезли, в мире появились чёрные башни-печати, а Нацуми стала обладательницей браслета девочки-волшебницы. Появившаяся принцесса Такицу объявила, что лишь уничтожение возникших после ритуала башен, охраняемых монстрами, вернёт на Землю мир и порядок.","year":2004,"type":"TV","genres":["Экшен","Приключения","Комедия","Фэнтези","Фантастика","этти","супер сила"],"rating":4.91,"popularity":2366,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/112/e8c23ef67c659b0ef489f67fef832002.jpeg","width":560,"height":800},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/88ef9c8301f613fb0dd979e4c292f852d3c03cfd.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-820","dubId":"820","label":"animereactor","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"pro